      "position": "Attacking Midfielder",
      "badge": null,
      "note": "The brightest young talent in Paraguayan football, Enciso has established himself in the Premier League with his creativity and direct running. His ability to carry the ball into dangerous areas and find incisive passes gives Paraguay an attacking threat that doesn't rely purely on the counter."
